            "attend": "Unlimited Events",
            "cities": "1 State"
          },
          {
            "membership": 1,
            "name": "Quattro",
            "description": "Curious? Our introductory local membership offers a taste of The Supper Club, without the full commitment. Quattro members may attend four events in the state of their choice per year. Please note that this tier is available to first time applicants only and does not include guest privileges or access to our And Beyond - nationwide weekend escapes and international trips.",
            "note": null,
            "image": {
